    {
      "id": "c08753d26a63e157",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "[▶基础点 5:由角的加减确定角范围](%E9%AB%98%E4%B8%AD/%E8%AF%BE%E5%A0%82%E5%90%8C%E6%AD%A5/%E9%A2%98%E5%BA%93/%E9%AB%98%E4%B8%AD%E6%95%B0%E5%AD%A6%E5%85%A8%E7%BB%83%E4%B8%80%E6%9C%AC%E9%80%9A/%E4%B8%89%E8%A7%92%E5%87%BD%E6%95%B0/%E7%AC%AC%E4%B8%80%E8%8A%82%20%E4%BB%BB%E6%84%8F%E8%A7%92%E4%B8%8E%E5%BC%A7%E5%BA%A6%E5%88%B6/%E2%96%B6%E5%9F%BA%E7%A1%80%E7%82%B9%205_%E7%94%B1%E8%A7%92%E7%9A%84%E5%8A%A0%E5%87%8F%E7%A1%AE%E5%AE%9A%E8%A7%92%E8%8C%83%E5%9B%B4/%E2%96%B6%E5%9F%BA%E7%A1%80%E7%82%B9%205_%E7%94%B1%E8%A7%92%E7%9A%84%E5%8A%A0%E5%87%8F%E7%A1%AE%E5%AE%9A%E8%A7%92%E8%8C%83%E5%9B%B4.md)",
